// CGS Portal - experimental live camera material for imported *_ViewPlane.
//
// The previous scope-style emat used a zero-alpha emission tint:
//     Emissive 1 1 1 0
//     EmissiveLV -3.429
// That was correct for a different scope design, but the Blue portal's
// raw imported white plane did not display the remote render.
//
// Adapted from known Reforger render-to-mesh materials in the
// Radar Development Framework Computer_Screen_RT and RTTest_Surface:
// Sample the same $rendertarget in both base color and emissive maps,
// use an opaque white tint and positive emissive brightness.
// ONLY the separate portal screen slot should use this material.
// Do not assign it to the frame or glow ring.
MatPBRBasic {
 Color 1 1 1 1
 Emissive 1 1 1 1
 EmissiveLV 5
 ApplyAlbedoToEmissive 1
 CastShadow 0
 OccludeRain 0
 OccludeWetness 0
 NoDecals 1
 Cull none
 RoughnessScale 0.2
 MetalnessScale 0
 EmissiveMap "$rendertarget"
 BCRMap "$rendertarget"
}
